Using
-----
1. Set the xml of the Appstartup correct
2. Start the Appstartup in the BINDIR with argument of the xml file
3. Open the DatabaseEditor
4. Open connection to the database
5. Update database
6. First startup the LogServer and then the 2UVServer (just startup not more to do there)
7. Fill up the database in ServerTest->menu..->configure (press refresh to see all the classes).
8. Check the different applications en run a bit through the code to see what is possible ... .

9. Methods can be addded and configured in the ServerTest or ObjectViewer BINDIR\Config
10. Object methods can be added and configured in the ServerTest or ObjectViewer BINDIR\CONFIG






